  "date": "2026-10-22",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行推出新工具，帮助稳定债券市场",
  "title_en": "Central bank launches a new tool to help stabilize the bond market",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "中国人民银行最近宣布，将和金融监管总局、证监会一起，推出一个新的流动性支持工具。这个工具主要是为了帮助非银行机构，比如银行理财公司和公募基金公司。",
      "en": "The People's Bank of China recently announced that, together with the National Financial Regulatory Administration and the China Securities Regulatory Commission, it will launch a new liquidity support tool. The tool is mainly meant to help non-bank institutions, such as bank wealth-management companies and public fund companies."
    },
    {
      "zh": "为什么需要这个工具？当很多投资者同时要求赎回时，这些机构手里的现金可能不够，只好卖出债券。债券价格下跌以后，更多投资者担心亏钱，又要赎回，这样就形成了“赎回—抛售”的恶性循环。",
      "en": "Why is this tool needed? When many investors ask to redeem at the same time, these institutions may not have enough cash on hand and have to sell bonds. After bond prices fall, more investors worry about losing money and redeem too, creating a \"redemption–sell-off\" vicious circle."
    },
    {
      "zh": "根据规定，使用这个工具的机构要符合宏观审慎要求，还要提供高等级的债券作为抵押品。",
      "en": "Under the rules, institutions using the tool must meet macro-prudential requirements and provide high-grade bonds as collateral."
    },
    {
      "zh": "具体的操作方法，央行以后会在公开市场业务公告中说明。",
      "en": "The central bank will explain the specific operating details later in its open market operation announcements."
    }
  ],
